# SECTION 1 — Creating DataFrames

## Import Pandas

```python
import pandas as pd
```

---

## Method 1 — Create DataFrame from Dictionary

```python
import pandas as pd

data = {
    'Name':   ['Rahul', 'Priya', 'Kiran', 'Ananya', 'Ravi'],
    'Age':    [25, 32, 19, 45, 28],
    'City':   ['Hyderabad', 'Mumbai', 'Bangalore', 'Chennai', 'Hyderabad'],
    'Orders': [8, 3, 15, 2, 10],
    'Spent':  [2400, 8000, 1500, 12000, 4200]
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

print(df)
```

### Output

| Name | Age | City | Orders | Spent |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Rahul | 25 | Hyderabad | 8 | 2400 |
| Priya | 32 | Mumbai | 3 | 8000 |
| Kiran | 19 | Bangalore | 15 | 1500 |
| Ananya | 45 | Chennai | 2 | 12000 |
| Ravi | 28 | Hyderabad | 10 | 4200 |

